+#### D-48 (Low): "The highest pay" and "The lowest pay" for roles that are not
+- **Viewport:** 1440x900, light.
+- **Repro:** open `/melon-seek/beta/#c=amazon&sort=salary-desc`, then the 1st, 10th, 30th and 50th card;
+  `#c=amazon&job=amazon%3A10409027` (part-time $19.70 an hour).
